# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Learner data — NEVER commit this.
#
# Learner profiles describe a specific child: reading level, executive
# function, accommodations, what they struggle with. That does not belong
# in a git repository, public or private.
#
# If you want to share a project design, share the plan, not the profile,
# and strip identifying details first. See docs/15-learner-profiles.md.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
learners/**
!learners/README.md
!learners/.gitkeep

# Standards cache — regenerate with `pbl standards sync`
.cache/
*.jsonl.tmp

# Node
node_modules/
dist/
*.tsbuildinfo
npm-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*
.npm/
*.tgz

# Environment
.env
.env.local
.env.*.local

# Editors
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp
*.swo
*~

# OS
.DS_Store
.DS_Store?
._*
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini

# Scratch
scratch/
tmp/
*.local.md
